Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 03:06:08 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 035/159] [ae-patch] Count only unblocked, unfailed working
 sessions as slots in the sidebar

The sidebar's Dashboard row read "4/3" while the Dashboard's Working section
read "3/3" (Reid, 2026-10-14). isAeSlot counted every ae.status=working
session, but the server decided on 2026-09-25 that a working session blocked
on an approval or whose last turn failed holds no slot
(ae_omni_policies.sessions.working_sessions, used by /v1/ae/capacity and the
slot cap). isAeSlot now applies the same two exclusions, so the Dashboard
row, the installed app badge and the status menu's fallback count agree with
the server.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
